This copy is modified for print-portal:
- Three.js 0.160.0 is vendored in ./three/ (MIT, see three/LICENSE). No CDN or other network fetch.
- STEP / occt-import-js support was removed. STL only.
- Upload, edit, confirm, and remote file= URL loading were removed.
- The parent page supplies the job STL with postMessage {type:"load_model", buffer, ext:"stl"}.
- The viewer posts viewer_ready, stl_preview_loaded, and stl_preview_error to its parent.
- prefers-reduced-motion disables the continuous animation loop.
